  "description": {
    "raw": "You take on an aspect of a nightingale. Your voice becomes clear and pleasant. You gain a +2 competence bonus on Perform (sing) checks and a +2 competence bonus on Diplomacy checks. Once per minute, if you are subject to a charm effect that allows a saving throw, you may roll twice and take the more favorable result.",
    "search_text": "\"you take on an aspect of a nightingale. your voice becomes clear and pleasant. you gain a +2 competence bonus on perform (sing) checks and a +2 competence bonus on diplomacy checks. once per minute, if you are subject to a charm effect that allows a saving throw, you may roll twice and take the more favorable result.\"",
    "sections": []
  },
